{"type":"message","id":"d90a4dfc","parentId":"749de65a","timestamp":"2026-05-11T10:35:31.261Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sí, pide varias acciones preventivas, pero dirigidas al agente principal/operador, no a mí como `TASK_VALIDATOR`.\n\nAcciones mencionadas:\n- Crear snapshots antes de cambios importantes.\n- Mantener/documentar `SANDBOX_POLICY.md`.\n- Mantener `TASK_VALIDATOR` con `sandbox.mode = off`.\n- Verificar Docker tras reinicios con `groups` y `docker ps`.\n- Separar agentes de ejecución y validación.\n- No activar herramientas innecesarias por defecto.\n\nYo no debo ejecutarlas; solo validarlas.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a18171b0d091f6016a01b0f11c348191ba5cac277588a2e5\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":447,"output":117,"cacheRead":5120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5684,"cost":{"input":0.002235,"output":0.00351,"cacheRead":0.0025599999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008305}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778495727541,"responseId":"resp_01a18171b0d091f6016a01b0f019c081918bb4b39628e73875"}}
