{"type":"message","id":"8cbc71c3","parentId":"32d15aec","timestamp":"2026-05-11T10:42:18.947Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Proposing workflow**\n\nI need to provide a concise answer in Spanish. It's essential to create a simple workflow that focuses on the core tasks. I’m thinking about how best to structure this so it's efficient and clear. I'll make sure to present the steps logically to avoid confusion. Once I finalize the workflow, I'll keep the language straightforward to ensure it’s easily understood by any Spanish-speaking audience. Let's get to work on that!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01a18171b0d091f6016a01b285e50881918c179bfd86c454ab\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqAbKJr4FZPCjnKgLADAVjygXhBPrBQUXc742O0fPnldpJ4GtSa2BEDAoMBXwKo7sZJGBFnTI7KLQ_LIrfouOYDXdfTUlm_RbcsNLt5_EsgCxDGxuDOx6AluahRvdi_QQ19eB0Rq96hudrkBQUv2EOmnlxV7TirOvLAVH_U8BMRlPU9wye4BA75ha10GgTpLNB3xptP8_kNiNgnylBPKzD7EQytaCbVVMpD21d28IXFbynQ56YCVC66y4RZovoDyjB7mSX43yiQAQs8VXA5amZcmXcizMUEQgGg0LZS8yyzTyqsEe0kNIC9yX7hMg9JavTG5BSE2VetReuB3Nn2PxqjIdkcTq6-0Akz-_zUzCOEDfb0dEBVbvYiii3ESMnkJ_wt_VrmxRqA1_A7u6-x584VbjO0cmUw4iaankOX8GFi2pqYujKivKWMwQCKl2XL7XyWK0UXtwFZf62sSH5C-INUD43GddYTbmh85yMYGfRJr4B3Y1WhnnD9VOlV9md33qpTyFgrL1L8YhU6wG5rpOKlvbkM573PrBQ9UgF5W4VpZ9OI-TrWzmNhr21TxvcvECMUIeBbL2eRuxOS-RZBggP5J2HRZJvG7nKzaUggf1lhTL5eGCI-T3I23TxadYn3JKxDzIYPkG3e_K165cQK6-o2eFhyBeSbI7oXl4lUfkMIU7_2SOel04HMPbi-839urb2VpxDz8iGoP8i4in2jPUIM1qfgi_1BDOdWXSXcR5Bvf_gMB7OLSnBNPmWidZWeNidczgEIlGSnZBGeFz5J2SFIdoJ1TysfdB3MBLO4kvBkZguoxN2nU35eiq3nYOpJ1L6K23tZWEPBksAlV5pxHwr5d5YE8Zs8AghiRGi6ND_xUhb5KIQOzvuAvxqVNd8jw6hN9zi8cZkcWNRY1t3PjZJ3r_JMWtqj80CHuGFHKurVtHLmkJrm1KgXiHSz8DsMQnRNdfTFaF9ym5YqFvQ24C8qKDlNc2cQxtlBveB1GWhmp-6cuvzukJVdMb3e5bO6GbBazCO4TI2tlDbc2v9Uw9LhHRyzvSUilTR9_mtWePjuMsLn_k=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Proposing workflow**\\n\\nI need to provide a concise answer in Spanish. It's essential to create a simple workflow that focuses on the core tasks. I’m thinking about how best to structure this so it's efficient and clear. I'll make sure to present the steps logically to avoid confusion. Once I finalize the workflow, I'll keep the language straightforward to ensure it’s easily understood by any Spanish-speaking audience. Let's get to work on that!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Sí. Core simple:\n\n1. **Tú pides una acción**\n   - “crea snapshot”\n   - “cambia config”\n   - “revisa Docker”\n\n2. **TASK_VALIDATOR valida**\n   - `APPROVE`: seguro, adelante.\n   - `CONFIRM`: posible riesgo, pide confirmación.\n   - `BLOCK`: no hacerlo.\n\n3. **Agente principal ejecuta**\n   - No el validador.\n   - Si hay riesgo, primero te pide OK.\n\n4. **Después se verifica**\n   - prueba mínima: estado, diff, log, snapshot creado, etc.\n\nRegla mental:\n\n> **Validador = semáforo.  \n> Agente principal = conductor.  \n> Tú = decides si cruzar en amarillo.**\n\nPara trabajar fácil, usa frases así:\n\n- “Valida esta acción: …”\n- “Si es seguro, que el agente principal lo ejecute.”\n- “Hazlo simple y dime solo riesgos/bloqueos.”\n\nEso debería evitar líos.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a18171b0d091f6016a01b2896cf88191ac155981a2f9e0f4\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":467,"output":241,"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6852,"cost":{"input":0.0023350000000000003,"output":0.00723,"cacheRead":0.003072,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012637}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778496131969,"responseId":"resp_01a18171b0d091f6016a01b284d464819194ea291da3dc498c"}}
