{"type":"message","id":"abb20821","parentId":"08b0fa8d","timestamp":"2026-05-11T11:20:39.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sí, confirmado con un matiz importante.\n\nEl subagente **solo evalúa**.\n\nFlujo correcto:\n\n1. Tú pides algo.\n2. El agente principal propone o prepara la acción.\n3. `TASK_VALIDATOR` evalúa:\n   - `APPROVE`\n   - `CONFIRM`\n   - `BLOCK`\n4. Si sale `APPROVE`, el agente principal puede hacerlo.\n5. Si sale `CONFIRM`, **tú dices “hazlo/confirmo”** y entonces el agente principal lo ejecuta.\n6. Si sale `BLOCK`, no debe hacerse.\n\nMatiz: cuando tú dices “hazlo”, **no lo hace el subagente validador**; lo hace el agente principal/ejecutor.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01a18171b0d091f6016a01bb8465ec8191b3f9985e33ab75fa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":619,"output":160,"cacheRead":7168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7947,"cost":{"input":0.003095,"output":0.0048000000000000004,"cacheRead":0.003584,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011479000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778498433785,"responseId":"resp_01a18171b0d091f6016a01bb824f3c81918f6fdfef08fb1c92"}}
